{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Fontes App API",
    "version": "0.1.2",
    "description": "Fontes app authentication, onboarding and briefings.\n\n## Create a user and a session\n\nNo existing account, session or bearer token is required for these two requests. In each endpoint, the Test Request panel accepts the JSON body below.\n\n1. **Send sign-in code**: `POST /api/auth/email-otp/send-verification-otp`.\n\n```json\n{\"email\":\"name@example.com\",\"type\":\"sign-in\"}\n```\n\nThis sends a six-digit code to the email address. It does not create a user yet. The code expires after 10 minutes.\n\n2. **Create user or sign in with code**: `POST /api/auth/sign-in/email-otp`, with the code received by email.\n\n```json\n{\"email\":\"name@example.com\",\"otp\":\"123456\",\"name\":\"Example Name\"}\n```\n\n`123456` is a placeholder. A valid code creates a verified user if the email is new, or signs in the existing user. Both cases create a session. `name` is optional and applies only to a new user. The response contains `token` and `user`; the browser also receives an HttpOnly session cookie.\n\n3. **Use the session**: the `token` response value belongs in the `sessionBearer` authentication field of the Test Request panel. The field accepts the token alone and sends `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. `GET /api/auth/get-session` returns the active session; browser requests on this documentation site also send its session cookie automatically. Both briefing endpoints require the explicit bearer header.\n\n## Existing password account\n\n**Sign in with password**: `POST /api/auth/sign-in/email` creates a new session for an existing account with a password.\n\n```json\n{\"email\":\"name@example.com\",\"password\":\"existing-password\"}\n```\n\nThe response contains the session `token`. A callbackURL is not required for this flow. This endpoint does not create users.\n\n## Password and profile after registration\n\nA new email-code account has no password yet. `POST /api/onboarding/password` accepts `{\"newPassword\":\"a-long-unique-password\"}` with the new session, within 15 minutes of login. The password must have 8 to 128 characters and can only be set once through this route. Profile and workspace setup use `/api/onboarding`; completion is not required to call the briefing endpoints.\n\nThere is no separate public email/password signup endpoint. The same email-code flow handles registration and login. Google sign-in also supports new accounts; the Fontes app manages the browser redirect flow.\n"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "Current environment"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Onboarding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Briefing"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/briefing": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Briefing"
        ],
        "summary": "Read cached briefing",
        "description": "Requires Authorization: Bearer <session-token> for a verified user. No query parameters or body. Reads the latest saved general briefing from D1 without invoking AI.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Saved or cached briefing."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing, invalid, expired or revoked session bearer token."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Verified email required."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "No briefing generated yet."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Generation in progress."
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Source generation failed; prior snapshot preserved."
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Briefing unavailable or not configured."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Parameters and request bodies are not supported."
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/briefing/generate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Briefing"
        ],
        "summary": "Generate  new briefing",
        "description": "Requires Authorization: Bearer <session-token> for a verified user. Generates a briefing for an explicit interval of at most 31 days. Exact interval results are reused from D1. Inputs, model response and usage are retained in generation history.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Saved or cached briefing."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing, invalid, expired or revoked session bearer token."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "No briefing generated yet."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Generation in progress or brief failure cooldown. Retry-After header indicates when to retry."
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Source generation failed; prior snapshot preserved."
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Briefing unavailable or not configured."
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "New briefing generated and saved."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid explicit interval."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Verified email required."
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "from",
                  "until"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "from": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date-time"
                  },
                  "until": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date-time"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/onboarding": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Onboarding"
        ],
        "summary": "Read onboarding state",
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          },
          {
            "sessionCookie": []
          },
          {
            "secureSessionCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid input."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Verified session required."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Trusted origin or workspace permission required."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Setup conflict."
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Onboarding"
        ],
        "summary": "Save onboarding setup",
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          },
          {
            "sessionCookie": []
          },
          {
            "secureSessionCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid input."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Verified session required."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Trusted origin or workspace permission required."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Setup conflict."
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "operationId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "slug": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "profileName": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "organizationId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "profileImage": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "completed": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "changelog": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "daily": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "revision": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "operationId",
                  "revision",
                  "name",
                  "slug",
                  "profileName",
                  "completed",
                  "changelog",
                  "daily"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/onboarding/password": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Onboarding"
        ],
        "summary": "Set the first password",
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          },
          {
            "sessionCookie": []
          },
          {
            "secureSessionCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid input."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Verified session required."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Trusted origin or workspace permission required."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Setup conflict."
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "newPassword": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 8,
                    "maxLength": 128
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "newPassword"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/onboarding/invite": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Onboarding"
        ],
        "summary": "Create or send an invitation",
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          },
          {
            "sessionCookie": []
          },
          {
            "secureSessionCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid input."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Verified session required."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Trusted origin or workspace permission required."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Setup conflict."
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
                  },
                  "organizationId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "email": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "format": "email"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "token",
                  "organizationId",
                  "email"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/onboarding/join": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Onboarding"
        ],
        "summary": "Accept an invitation",
        "security": [
          {
            "sessionBearer": []
          },
          {
            "sessionCookie": []
          },
          {
            "secureSessionCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid input."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Verified session required."
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Trusted origin or workspace permission required."
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Setup conflict."
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "token"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "sessionCookie": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "better-auth.session_token",
        "description": "Local HTTP session; managed by the browser."
      },
      "secureSessionCookie": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "__Secure-better-auth.session_token",
        "description": "HTTPS session; managed by the browser."
      },
      "sessionBearer": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "Session token returned by sign-in (token), GET /api/auth/get-session (session.token), or the set-auth-token response header. Requires a live session for a verified user; expires or is revoked with the session."
      }
    }
  }
}
